This is a bitmask DP over slot usage, with each slot's occupancy (0, 1 or 2) stored as a base-3 digit.

The state is a base-3 number of length `numSlots`, where digit `j` is how many numbers slot `j+1` holds. There are at most 3^9 = 19683 states. Process the numbers in order. For state `s`, the count of numbers already placed is the sum of its digits, so that count is the index of the next number to place. Then `dp[s]` is the best sum with the first `count` numbers placed according to `s`.

Transition: for each slot `j` with digit less than 2, set `dp[s + 3^j] = max(dp[s + 3^j], dp[s] + (nums[count] & (j+1)))`.

Iterating `s` in increasing order is safe because every transition increases the state value. The answer is the maximum `dp[s]` over states whose digit sum equals `n`. Since `n <= 2*numSlots`, such states exist.

Implementation: initialize `dp` to -1 (unreachable) with `dp[0] = 0`. For each `s` with `dp[s] >= 0`, compute the digit sum, skipping the state if it is `>= n`, and otherwise try each slot. Track the best value when the digit sum equals `n`.

```typescript
function maximumANDSum(nums: number[], numSlots: number): number {
    const n = nums.length;
    const pow: number[] = [1];
    for (let i = 1; i <= numSlots; i++) pow.push(pow[i - 1] * 3);
    const total = pow[numSlots];
    const dp = new Array<number>(total).fill(-1);
    dp[0] = 0;
    let best = 0;
    for (let s = 0; s < total; s++) {
        if (dp[s] < 0) continue;
        let cnt = 0;
        const digits: number[] = [];
        let t = s;
        for (let j = 0; j < numSlots; j++) {
            const d = t % 3;
            digits.push(d);
            cnt += d;
            t = Math.floor(t / 3);
        }
        if (cnt === n) {
            if (dp[s] > best) best = dp[s];
            continue;
        }
        if (cnt > n) continue;
        for (let j = 0; j < numSlots; j++) {
            if (digits[j] < 2) {
                const ns = s + pow[j];
                const v = dp[s] + (nums[cnt] & (j + 1));
                if (v > dp[ns]) dp[ns] = v;
            }
        }
    }
    return best;
};
