- `'/'` unites top with left (0 and 3) and right with bottom (1 and 2).
- `'\'` unites top with right (0 and 1) and bottom with left (2 and 3).

Between cells:
- The bottom triangle (2) of cell (i,j) unites with the top triangle (0) of cell (i+1,j).
- The right triangle (1) of cell (i,j) unites with the left triangle (3) of cell (i,j+1).

