- Left count: the number of starts with an even offset (i-s even) is floor(i/2)+1, and with an odd offset it is ceil(i/2) = floor((i+1)/2).
- Right count: with r = n-1-i, the even-offset ends number floor(r/2)+1, and the odd-offset ends number floor((r+1)/2).
